		{"id":"6d809bb8f14dea3e","type":"text","text":"# Rasterization:\n– Scanline algorithm to enumerate hit pixels\n– Local illumination using Phong lighting\n– Occlusion using depth buffer\n\n```\nfor each triangle t\n\tfind pixels inside t\n\t\tshade pixel\n```\n\n# Ray casting\n```\nfor each pixel p\ncast a ray through pixel p\nshade p\n```\n- find scene point visible in p.\n\n# Ray tracing\n- physically motivated illumination\n- ","x":10735,"y":6494,"width":571,"height":856},
